# Dispatch one task to one robot. fleet_manager acts as the client: it picks a
# robot with the greedy cost function and sends this goal to that robot's
# NavigateToPose-driven task server.
# NOTE: an action file needs exactly two three-dash separators. Never put one
# inside a comment, or the rosidl parser counts it as a real section split.

# goal
Task task

---

# result
bool     success
string   robot_id
float32  completion_time_sec      # wall/sim time from goal accept to COMPLETED
float32  energy_wh                # energy consumed while executing
string   message                  # human readable outcome / failure reason

---

# feedback
string               phase        # PENDING|ASSIGNED|TO_PICKUP|LOADING|TO_DROPOFF
geometry_msgs/Pose2D current_pose
float32              progress     # 0.0 .. 1.0
